{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e17-scene-18",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "狠心推开为了护她周全  (Pushing Her Away to Protect Her)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "chun_yuqiao": "淳于乔"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Alone in the corridor after the confrontation, Bu Xiaogu begs Chun Yuqiao not to ruin his career at Xingtian, forcing him to speak harsh words to keep her safe. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果我把你惹生气了，你骂我就好了呀，你删成片干吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我删成片跟你有什么关系？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道昨晚你不痛快，我现在郑重地跟你道歉，对不起！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "总编室没了我什么都没事，但绝对不能没有你！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "布小谷，你行行好，别再自作多情了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "魅力远航延播那是公司大事，我怎么做你没资格插嘴。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你以为我会为了你做决定吗？你是我什么人啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "替我操心，替我顶包，你还不配！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道我不配，我也不是你什么人！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "既然知道，你还在这儿发什么疯？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一年前我因为李铭基的事进了公安局，今天你再把我送进去算了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你现在是彻底烦我了，对吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "之前的事就当都没有发生过，我离职之前，先让她停职别来公司。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果我把你惹生气了，你骂我就好了呀，你删成片干吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If I upset you last night, you could have just scolded me—why delete the master cut?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我删成片跟你有什么关系？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What does my deleting the master cut have to do with you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道昨晚你不痛快，我现在郑重地跟你道歉，对不起！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know last night made you unhappy, so I apologise to you solemnly right now—I am sorry!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "总编室没了我什么都没事，但绝对不能没有你！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'The Chief Editor's Office will be fine without me, yet it cannot do without you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "布小谷，你行行好，别再自作多情了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Bu Xiaogu, do me a favour and stop flattering yourself!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "魅力远航延播那是公司大事，我怎么做你没资格插嘴。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Postponing the travel show is a major company matter; how I handle it is none of your business.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "你以为我会为了你做决定吗？你是我什么人啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Do you imagine I would make decisions over you? Who are you to me anyway?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "替我操心，替我顶包，你还不配！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Worrying on my behalf and taking the fall for me—you are not worthy of that!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "我知道我不配，我也不是你什么人！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I know I am not worthy, and I know I am nobody to you!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "既然知道，你还在这儿发什么疯？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you know that, why are you acting crazy right here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "一年前我因为李铭基的事进了公安局，今天你再把我送进去算了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'A year ago I landed at the police station over Li Mingji—go ahead and send me back there today!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你现在是彻底烦我了，对吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You are completely sick of me now, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "之前的事就当都没有发生过，我离职之前，先让她停职别来公司。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Treat everything earlier as if it never happened—and until I leave Xingtian, keep her suspended away from the office.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "如果我把你惹生气了，你骂我就好了呀，你删成片干吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "chun_yuqiao",
      "t": "我删成片跟你有什么关系？",
      "gap": 0.5
